flowchart LR
    A[NYC TLC Parquet or sample generator] --> B[Bronze immutable raw files]
    B --> C[Silver normalized trips]
    C --> D{Quality Gate}
    D -->|pass| E[Gold daily metrics]
    D -->|fail| X[Fail loudly and report rejected rows]
    E --> F[DuckDB or BI consumer]
    G[Airflow DAG] -. schedule and backfill .-> B
    G -. retries and observability .-> C
    G -. publish .-> E
